Josh 1:1 , The Lord appoints Joshua to succeed Moses;
Josh 1:3 , The borders of the promised land;
Josh 1:5 , God promises to assist Joshua;
Josh 1:8 , He gives him instructions;
Josh 1:10 , Joshua prepares the people to pass over Jordan;
Josh 1:12 , He puts the two tribes and half in mind of their promise to Moses;
Josh 1:16 , They promise him fealty.
